  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ekiti-Eleven Rice Value Chain Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The primary focus will be rice production and processing. The cooperative intends to build their capacities in best agronomy practices for cassava cultivation and modernized method of cassava processing. They also intend to improve their financial management and organizational capacities. Similarly, they want to take an advantage of wider market opportunities through improved quality of cassava production and marketing skills. The grant will likewise create job opportunities for people within the community.</narrative>
  </description>
